# Reserved for bundled skills shipped with Fun Claw.
#
# v1 ships zero bundled skills — the dominant pattern (REQUIREMENTS.md
# Flow 7) is users asking the agent to author skills directly into
# their user-level skills directory. Future bundled skills land here as
# subdirectories: `bundled/<name>/SKILL.md` + `bundled/<name>/scripts/`.
#
# This file's only job is to keep the directory present in git so the
# discovery walker has a stable path to look in. Replace with real
# skills when v1.x adds them.
